{"id":11,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"宇宙教育と一貫指導で知性を磨く女子校","feature_description":"セントヨゼフ女子学園中学校・高等学校は、6年間を通じた一貫指導の中で、知識の理解、思考力、表現力を育てます。生徒が自分の特性に気づき、学習意欲を高めて進路を実現できるよう、キャリア教育や習熟度に応じたコースを用意しています。日常生活と体験的な学習を通じて、主体的に学び社会に貢献する精神を養う女子校です。ICTも活用します。","clubs":[{"id":215,"name":"陸上部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://sjjg.ac.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":216,"name":"ソフトボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://sjjg.ac.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":217,"name":"テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://sjjg.ac.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":218,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://sjjg.ac.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":219,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://sjjg.ac.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":220,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://sjjg.ac.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":221,"name":"GlobalCommunicationUnion(EEC)","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://sjjg.ac.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":222,"name":"ギター•マンドリン部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://sjjg.ac.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":223,"name":"美術部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://sjjg.ac.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":224,"name":"茶道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://sjjg.ac.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":225,"name":"書道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://sjjg.ac.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":226,"name":"合唱部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://sjjg.ac.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":227,"name":"筝部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://sjjg.ac.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":228,"name":"料理部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://sjjg.ac.jp/school-life